| # | Problem | Fix |
|---|---------|-----|
| 1 | `usedLvl` never cleared → stale tracking | Add `usedLvl.clear()` after flushing |
| 2 | `toCharArray()` called once but `arr[i]` reset needed per char | Move `arr` inside the `i` loop |
| 3 | Mutating `v` in-place is fragile | Build `temp` directly from `v` + new word |

